  m_Name: Ipuwer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCData
  npcName: Ipuwer
  npcSprite: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueBubbles:
  - snippets:
    - They called me Ipuwer.
    - I prepared bodies for eternity in the purification tents of Abydos.
  - snippets:
    - I pulled brains through noses and packed bodies with natron salt. It is a precise art.
  - snippets:
    - But I grew too comfortable. I forgot to clean my bronze blade and cut my hand on a diseased lung.
  - snippets:
    - The rot spread to my blood. I become dangerously careless when tasks feel too routine.
